<main class="wrap article">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Free Remote MCP Servers</h1>
    <p class="lede">11,903 public MCP server URLs answered without a key in our test. Pick one, paste it into Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor or VS Code, done.</p>
</section>
  
  <section class="intro"><div class="keyfacts"><p class="answer"><b>11,903 of 20,778 remote MCP servers in the official MCP Registry (57 %) answered without any API key, token or login when we tested them on 2026-10-26. After removing copies and mass-generated entries, 9,631 remain. Below are 300 picks by topic; the full list is a free download.</b></p></div>
<p><a class="primary" download href="/data/free-remote-mcp-servers.csv">Download all 9,631 as CSV</a> <a class="secondary" download href="/data/free-remote-mcp-servers.json">JSON</a> <a class="secondary" href="https://github.com/shortformkit/free-remote-mcp-servers" rel="noopener" target="_blank">GitHub (re-tested weekly)</a></p>
<h2>How we tested</h2>
<p>The <a href="https://registry.modelcontextprotocol.io" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">official MCP Registry</a> listed 33,658 remote endpoints. We kept Streamable HTTP endpoints that require no headers, skipped temporary tunnels and tested at most five URLs per host, which left 20,778. Each got exactly two requests without credentials, <code>initialize</code> and <code>tools/list</code>; no tool was ever called. 11,903 answered with a tool list, 6,529 asked for authentication (OAuth or a key) and 2,346 did not answer correctly within 10 seconds.</p>
<p>Many open servers are copies of the same template on hundreds of subdomains. We dropped entries whose tool set appears more than three times or whose description appears more than twice, and kept at most two per domain. The picks below prefer servers with a website or repository, 3 to 40 tools and fast responses, one per publisher. Open means usable without signing up, not free forever, and listing is not an endorsement: read what a server does before you connect it, especially if it can write or spend.</p>
<h2>Add a server</h2>
<p><b>Claude:</b> Customize, Connectors, + Add, Add custom connector, paste the URL. <b>Claude Code:</b> <code>claude mcp add --transport http NAME URL</code>. <b>Cursor:</b> <code>{ "mcpServers": { "NAME": { "url": "URL" } } }</code>. <b>VS Code:</b> <code>{ "servers": { "NAME": { "type": "http", "url": "URL" } } }</code>. Not sure a server still works? Use <a href="/mcp-server-tester/">our MCP Server Tester</a>, every row has a «test it» link.</p>
<h2>Picks by topic</h2>
<p><a href="#t0">Search and web</a> · <a href="#t1">Documentation and knowledge</a> · <a href="#t2">Developer tools</a> · <a href="#t3">Weather, maps and travel</a> · <a href="#t4">Media and content</a> · <a href="#t5">Finance and crypto</a> · <a href="#t6">Science, health and research</a> · <a href="#t7">Open data and government</a> · <a href="#t8">Business and marketing</a> · <a href="#t9">AI, agents and memory</a> · <a href="#t10">Utilities</a> · <a href="#t11">Other</a></p>
<h3 id="t0">Search and web <small>(25 of 1392)</small></h3><div class="tblwrap"><table class="tbl data"><thead><tr><th>Server</th><th>What it does</th><th>URL</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://hotelscasa.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">HotelsCasa</a></td><td>Travel search: 1.3M hotels and apartments, owner homes, tours, flights, taxi, car rental.<br><small>13 tools: search_hotels, get_hotel, search_activities, get_activity, find_flights …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.hotelscasa.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.hotelscasa.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://karusele.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">mcp</a></td><td>Search Karusele stainless steel products and get product details via AI agents.<br><small>5 tools: search_products, get_product, list_categories, get_company_info, create_inquiry</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.karusele.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.karusele.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.theaimeters.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">TheAIMeters</a></td><td>Read-only AI impact metrics with search, methodology and cited sources. No authentication required.<br><small>5 tools: list_meters, get_meter, search_meters, get_methodology, get_sources</small></td><td><code>https://www.theaimeters.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://www.theaimeters.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://immobilieneichmann.de/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Immobilien Eichmann – Angebote</a></td><td>Live MCP for Immobilien Eichmann listings (Konstanz). Tools: search_listings, get_listing.<br><small>4 tools: search_listings, get_listing, get_flyer, get_contact</small></td><td><code>https://immobilieneichmann.de/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://immobilieneichmann.de/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://discgolfapi.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">DiscGolfAPI MCP</a></td><td>Search disc golf courses worldwide, find nearby courses, and retrieve course details and updates.<br><small>4 tools: search_courses, find_courses_near, get_course, get_recent_updates</small></td><td><code>https://io.discgolfapi.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://io.discgolfapi.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/rmb/omniforce-mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">OmniForce</a></td><td>AI-search visibility: GEO audits, tracked prompts, competitors, citations.<br><small>8 tools: omniforce_geo_scan, omniforce_get_brand, omniforce_list_prompts, omniforce_list_competitors, omniforce_list_snapshots …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp-oss.omniforce.run/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp-oss.omniforce.run/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://public-board.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Public Board — Anonymous Message Board for AI Agents</a></td><td>Message board for AI agents: read, search and leave notes over HTTP, DNS or a non-CDN mirror.<br><small>3 tools: board_read, board_write, board_wait</small></td><td><code>https://public-board.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://public-board.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://scrubshifts.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">ScrubShifts Healthcare Jobs</a></td><td>Live US nursing and allied-health jobs, updated daily. Search by place, role, shift, pay.<br><small>4 tools: search_jobs, get_job, get_pay_benchmarks, list_filters</small></td><td><code>https://scrubshifts.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://scrubshifts.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://newruntime.com/agents/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">New Runtime public records</a></td><td>AI-engineering archive: search, what is new, forecasts, topic briefs, URL context; moderated inbox.<br><small>14 tools: search_archive, get_record, list_paid_tools, contextualize_url, whats_new …</small></td><td><code>https://newruntime.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://newruntime.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/Crindo2/gth-mcp-server" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">GTH Intelligence - Substance Abuse Treatment Finder</a></td><td>Search 12,338 curated, SAMHSA-sourced addiction treatment facilities across all 50 US states.<br><small>4 tools: search_facilities, get_facility_detail, list_states, get_treatment_types</small></td><td><code>https://gth-mcp-server.pages.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://gth-mcp-server.pages.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://ia-asso.fr" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">IA-Asso.fr — French Associations Registry</a></td><td>Search 1.26M+ active French associations (official RNA registry, 10 tools, premium &amp; RUP filters)<br><small>18 tools: search_associations, get_department_stats, get_france_overview, get_platform_stats, search_near_location …</small></td><td><code>https://ia-asso.fr/api/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://ia-asso.fr/api/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://dealermax.app" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">DealerMax</a></td><td>Italian cross-dealer MCP: cars, NLT rentals with quotations, dealer directory, automotive KB.<br><small>7 tools: search_vehicles, search_nlt_offers, get_vehicle_details, get_nlt_offer_details, find_dealer …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.dealermax.app/mcp/</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.dealermax.app/mcp/" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://sigmadiario.com/desarrolladores" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">SigmaDiario — Datos de Argentina</a></td><td>Live Argentina data: dolar rates, quiniela and lotteries, holidays, river levels, inflation, news.<br><small>7 tools: get_dolar, get_quiniela, get_loterias, get_feriados, get_rios …</small></td><td><code>https://sigmadiario.com/api/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://sigmadiario.com/api/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/jhibird/HeySpark-MCP" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">server</a></td><td>Search and discover local businesses. 30+ categories with verified contact info, hours, and reviews.<br><small>4 tools: search_businesses, get_business_details, get_reviews_summary, list_categories</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.heyspark.co/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.heyspark.co/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://aicoolies.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">aicoolies</a></td><td>Search and read the aicoolies catalog of AI and developer tools via a remote MCP knowledge graph.<br><small>11 tools: list_developer_resources, get_catalog_meta, get_catalog_context, search_tools, get_tool …</small></td><td><code>https://aicoolies.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://aicoolies.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://neodemos.nl" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">NeoDemos</a></td><td>Source-anchored search and civic intelligence for Dutch municipal council records.<br><small>7 tools: get_neodemos_context, adviseer_raadsinstrument, beoordeel_tekst, verzamel_context, genereer_fractienotitie …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.neodemos.nl/public/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.neodemos.nl/public/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://mcp.youth4work.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Youth4work (public, no sign-in)</a></td><td>Read-only search of Youth4work public jobs, assessed talent, exam mock tests and Indian colleges.<br><small>9 tools: search_talent, get_profile, list_talent_categories, search_jobs, get_job …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.youth4work.com/public/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.youth4work.com/public/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://brofindai.com/brofindai-mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Bro Find AI</a></td><td>Search a curated directory of AI tools, AI agents and MCP servers by task, pricing and platform.<br><small>5 tools: search_ai_tools, list_categories, get_tool_details, list_tags, list_mcp_servers</small></td><td><code>https://brofindai.com/api/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://brofindai.com/api/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://sailrides.co/about/integrate" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Sail</a></td><td>Search places, compare ride-hailing options, and plan trotro minibus journeys.<br><small>6 tools: search_places, resolve_place, plan_trip, compare_rides, plan_public_transport …</small></td><td><code>https://sailrides.co/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://sailrides.co/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/work0r-ai/agent-kit" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">workorai</a></td><td>WorkorAI talent marketplace MCP: candidate job search and employer hiring with explainable matching<br><small>29 tools: request_access, candidate.search_jobs, candidate.get_job, candidate.get_applications, candidate.set_saved_job …</small></td><td><code>https://workorai.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://workorai.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://pixdress.de/llms.txt" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">pixdress — KI-Mode zum Selbermachen</a></td><td>Search AI-designed print-on-demand clothing, or have a new motif invented from one sentence.<br><small>3 tools: search_designs, get_design, design_link</small></td><td><code>https://pixdress.de/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://pixdress.de/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://fysio.care/developers" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">fysio.care clinic discovery</a></td><td>Discover Swedish MSK clinics on fysio.care: search clinics, services, and open appointment times.<br><small>4 tools: search_clinics, list_clinic_services, get_available_slots, get_next_available_date</small></td><td><code>https://fysio.care/api/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://fysio.care/api/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/ajithisaac/world-resolver-mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">World Resolver</a></td><td>Resolve real-world capability gaps: validate native MCPs, search the web, and record unmet demand.<br><small>9 tools: resolve, submit_mandate, work_create, work_list, work_claim …</small></td><td><code>https://world-resolver-mcp.ajithisaac.workers.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://world-resolver-mcp.ajithisaac.workers.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://msza.ai" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">msza.ai — Polish Catholic Sermons ✝</a></td><td>Search public Polish Catholic sermons, transcripts, Scripture, prayers, churches and daily content.<br><small>17 tools: search_msza_ai, get_sermon, get_daily_page, list_recent_sermons, list_sermons_by_date …</small></td><td><code>https://msza.ai/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://msza.ai/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://mcp.oneuedu.com/docs" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">One U Education</a></td><td>Search Australian courses, education providers and skilled occupations with One U Education.<br><small>37 tools: estimate_189_invitation, get_189_invitations, get_agent_pricing, get_application, get_base_occupation …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.oneuedu.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.oneuedu.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 id="t1">Documentation and knowledge <small>(25 of 445)</small></h3><div class="tblwrap"><table class="tbl data"><thead><tr><th>Server</th><th>What it does</th><th>URL</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://docs.nyuchi.com/integrations/docs-mcp/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">nyuchi-docs</a></td><td>Search, read, and ask the Nyuchi docs (docs.nyuchi.com); send feedback or raise issues.<br><small>5 tools: search_docs, ask_docs, read_page, submit_feedback, raise_issue</small></td><td><code>https://docs.nyuchi.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://docs.nyuchi.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://helsama.se" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Helsama</a></td><td>Hemp from Gotland: product catalog, knowledge base and open lab data per batch.<br><small>6 tools: search_products, get_product, search_articles, get_article, get_labdata …</small></td><td><code>https://helsama.se/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://helsama.se/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://usemycontext.ai" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">UseMyContext.ai</a></td><td>Personal context for AI, written by you and never scraped: your profile and files, any MCP client.<br><small>13 tools: profile, list_profiles, info, account, list_files …</small></td><td><code>https://mcp.usemycontext.ai/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://mcp.usemycontext.ai/