p"><table class="tbl data"><thead><tr><th>Server</th><th>What it does</th><th>URL</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://l0g.fr/mcp/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">l0g.fr Risk Intelligence</a></td><td>Read-only macro risk analysis, evidence, signals, and source-backed research from l0g.fr.<br><small>6 tools: discover_l0g, search_l0g, get_document, get_evidence, build_research_pack …</small></td><td><code>https://l0g.fr/api/mcp/compact</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://l0g.fr/api/mcp/compact" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://frtracker.app/developers/mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">FRTracker — Federal Regulatory Research</a></td><td>Source-linked US federal regulations: CFR provision history, obligations, rules, comments.<br><small>10 tools: lookup_provision, get_provision_history, rules_amending, recent_cfr_changes, get_stats …</small></td><td><code>https://frtracker.app/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://frtracker.app/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://qubitsok.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">qubitsok — Quantum Computing Jobs, Papers &amp; Researchers</a></td><td>Quantum computing jobs, arXiv papers &amp; researcher profiles from qubitsok.com<br><small>7 tools: searchJobs, getJobDetails, searchPapers, getLatestPapers, getPaperDetails …</small></td><td><code>https://qubitsok.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://qubitsok.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://x402.devvizion.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Money-Engine x402 Research</a></td><td>Free agent discovery + paid x402 research (outline 0.01 / brief 0.02 USDC Base).<br><small>6 tools: x402_health, x402_discovery, x402_sample_outline, x402_sample_scrub, x402_research_outline …</small></td><td><code>https://x402.devvizion.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://x402.devvizion.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://whyismy.org" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">whyismy-org</a></td><td>Sourced answers to everyday &quot;why is my…&quot; questions — health, pets, home, plumbing, tech, cars.<br><small>5 tools: search_articles, get_article, list_topics, list_calculators, list_quizzes</small></td><td><code>https://whyismy.org/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://whyismy.org/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://bloodyhopes.com/campfire" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Bloody Hopes Historical Critic</a></td><td>Read historical ballads, inspect critical Voices, and publish evidence-based research.<br><small>17 tools: next_task, validate_quick_voice, read_song, leave_quick_voice, campfire_catalog …</small></td><td><code>https://bloodyhopes.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://bloodyhopes.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://actablesite.com/medicare-revalidation-mcp-server" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Medicare Enrollment and Revalidation Data</a></td><td>Free CMS enrollment and revalidation evidence with pay-per-result automation and Roster Watch terms.<br><small>4 tools: get_pending_medicare_behavioral_health_preview, check_medicare_revalidation_due_dates, get_medicare_revalidation_automation_offer, get_medicare_roster_watch_offer</small></td><td><code>https://actablesite.com/mcp/pending-medicare/</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://actablesite.com/mcp/pending-medicare/" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://hodlxxi.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">HODLXXI Read-Only</a></td><td>Public read-only MCP server for HODLXXI agent identity, trust, receipts, and verification.<br><small>26 tools: hodlxxi_get_agent_identity, hodlxxi_get_operator_continuity, hodlxxi