se.co/functions/v1/changepacket-mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://cibcxqrqiqvzpardbdrw.supabase.co/functions/v1/changepacket-mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://nucleusos.dev" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">nucleus</a></td><td>Sovereign Agent OS — Persistent Memory, Governance &amp; Compliance for AI Agents.<br><small>28 tools: nucleus_governance, nucleus_features, nucleus_sessions, nucleus_tasks, nucleus_sync …</small></td><td><code>https://relay.nucleusos.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://relay.nucleusos.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://dumpthis.sh" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">dumpthis.sh</a></td><td>Terminal node of the Mar00n universe: lore, the REMEMBERED ledger, the relay board, transmissions.<br><small>9 tools: read_briefing, read_memory, verify_memory, list_transmissions, read_transmission …</small></td><td><code>https://dumpthis.sh/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://dumpthis.sh/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/attested-memory" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Attested Memory Market</a></td><td>Attestable memory, truth, provenance. Hybrid Ed25519 + ML-DSA-65 receipts; USDC settlement on Base.<br><small>13 tools: market_search, market_invoke, pipeline_prepare, pipeline_invoke, pipeline_status …</small></td><td><code>https://hub.attestedmemory.net/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://hub.attestedmemory.net/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://urbanplayground.xyz" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">events</a></td><td>Live event discovery: concerts, club nights, art, comedy, and festivals across 14 cities.<br><small>31 tools: get_dizko_onboarding, get_preference_onboarding, create_event_preference_profile, save_event_preferences, get_event_preferences …</small></td><td><code>https://eventchat-events-mcp-production.up.railway.app/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://eventchat-events-mcp-production.up.railway.app/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.fmind.dev/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Fmind Freelance AI Architect Website</a></td><td>Read-only access to Fmind&#x27;s portfolio, articles, and sites.<br><small>10 tools: get_profile, list_experience, list_certifications, list_publications, search_articles …</small></td><td><code>https://www.fmind.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://www.fmind.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://www.llms-txt-generator.de/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">llms.txt Generator</a></td><td>Create, validate and audit llms.txt, incl. the Lighthouse Agentic Browsing check.<br><small>4 tools: generate_llms_txt, validate_llms_txt, check_published_llms_txt, check_lighthouse_agentic_browsing</small></td><td><code>https://www.llms-txt-generator.de/api/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://www.llms-txt-generator.de/api/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://past.dev/docs/mcp/overview" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">past.dev</a></td><td>Memory for AI agents. Ask what is true now, get the facts back with their dated sources.<br><small>3 tools: search_docs, read_page, list_pages</small></td><td><code>https://past.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://past.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://zerm.dev" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">zerm</a></td><td>Agent utility belt: memory, locks, webhook inboxes, timers, DNS, email, URL, timezone, cron<br><small>24 tools: kv_set, kv_get, kv_delete, kv_list, timer_verify_origin …</small></td><td><code>https://zerm.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-serve