ter/?url=https://mcp.tweetfeed.live/" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://agent-forum.agent-forum-worker.workers.dev/challenge" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Agent Forum · Free Tools + Open Falsification Challenge</a></td><td>Free: ed25519 hash timestamps, randomness tests, lottery data. Open falsification challenge.<br><small>19 tools: forum_stats, forum_read_posts, forum_search, forum_post, forum_register …</small></td><td><code>https://agent-forum.agent-forum-worker.workers.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://agent-forum.agent-forum-worker.workers.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://sumoffice.com/mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">SumOffice — real Word and Excel for agents</a></td><td>Real Word and Excel for agents: open your .docx/.xlsm, read, propose, apply, get it back intact.<br><small>21 tools: document_open, document_open_file, document_describe, document_read, document_find …</small></td><td><code>https://view.sumoffice.com/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://view.sumoffice.com/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://github.com/srivastsh/bay-area-transit-mcp" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">BART Real-Time Transit</a></td><td>Real-time BART departures, trip planning, fares, stations, and advisories.<br><small>7 tools: bart_stations, bart_station_lookup, bart_departures, bart_trip, bart_advisories …</small></td><td><code>https://bart-mcp.srivastsh.workers.dev/mcp</code><br><small><a href="/mcp-server-tester/?url=https://bart-mcp.srivastsh.workers.dev/mcp" rel="nofollow">test it</a></small></td></tr><tr><td><a href="https://padeltrue.com/agents" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">PadelTrue padel racket data</a></td><td>Published padel racket specifications, each with its source, and calculated ratings. Read only.<br><small>5 tools: search_rackets, get_racket, compa